{"html": "<section class=\"ec-product-scenarios ec-library-detail-section\" id=\"product-use-scenarios\" data-scene-ver=\"7\" aria-labelledby=\"product-scenario-title\"><p class=\"ec-scenario-kicker\">用途与选型</p><h2 id=\"product-scenario-title\">适用场景建议</h2><p class=\"ec-scenario-role\">82 oz 塑料冰具</p><div class=\"ec-scenario-grid\"><article class=\"ec-scenario-card\"><h3><a href=\"/zh/open-air-nightclub/\">户外酒吧 <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></h3><p>塑料制冰/取冰件。冰铲带沥水孔，冰化得慢，杯子不泡在水里。</p></article><article class=\"ec-scenario-card\"><h3><a href=\"/zh/backyard-bbq-cups/\">后院烧烤 <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></h3><p>院子里的冰箱和冰桶之间来回用，取冰不脏手。</p></article></div><div class=\"ec-scenario-check\"><h3>项目确认</h3><p>核对出杯速度、叠放收纳与夜间照明条件；长桌摆位、多人轮次与清洗条件。</p></div><p class=\"ec-scenario-note\">以上为选型建议。请按实际用途审核所选配置与样品。</p><a class=\"ec-scenario-cta\" href=\"/zh/contact/?models=JBPJ-029\">讨论 JBPJ-029 的应用方案 →</a></section>", "kind": "product"}